{"id":"5d8c59019598b33c","group":"92","path":"92/92-fact-sub-recursive.md","title":"fact-sub-recursive — Substitution is Recursive","display":"fact-sub-recursive — Substitution is Recursive","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-fact-sub-recursive","aliases":["92-fact-sub-recursive"],"display":"fact-sub-recursive — Substitution is Recursive","depends_on":["[[92-df-substitution-function]]","[[92-df-recursive-function]]","[[92-df-arithmetization-formula]]"],"source":"第 II 章 pp. 24–25（PDF 41–42）","source_status":"本地替换算术化"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-fact-sub-recursive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-fact-sub-recursive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-sub-recursive — Substitution is Recursive"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"067a36526639087d\" href=\"?note=067a36526639087d\" title=\"92-df-substitution-function\">92-df-substitution-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"af5c6b1bb1806001\" href=\"?note=af5c6b1bb1806001\" title=\"92-df-arithmetization-formula\">92-df-arithmetization-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 II 章 pp. 24–25（PDF 41–42）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地替换算术化"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}\\)</span> (substitution function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"067a36526639087d\" href=\"?note=067a36526639087d\" title=\"92-df-substitution-function\">92-df-substitution-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)\\)</span> (formula-code set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> (code candidate and substituted number)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{\\mathrm{Sub}}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\widehat{\\mathrm{Sub}}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (total extension of substitution)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span> (recursive-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}sub\\text{-}recursive}\\vdash\n\\widehat{\\mathrm{Sub}}(m,n)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\mathrm{Sub}(m,n),&amp;m\\in\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G),\\\\0,&amp;m\\notin\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G),\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Rec}(\\widehat{\\mathrm{Sub}})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}sub\\text{-}recursive}\\vdash\n\\widehat{\\mathrm{Sub}}(m,n)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\mathrm{Sub}(m,n),&amp;m\\in\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G),\\\\0,&amp;m\\notin\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G),\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Rec}(\\widehat{\\mathrm{Sub}})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>原始<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}\\)</span>只在公式码上有定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{\\mathrm{Sub}}\">\\(\\widehat{\\mathrm{Sub}}\\)</span>是其默认值为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>的全扩张</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}(m, n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}(m, n)\\)</span>可计算：\n<ol>\n<li>解码<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>得到公式<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x)\">\\(\\varphi(x)\\)</span></li>\n<li>构造numeral <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar{n}\">\\(\\bar{n}\\)</span></li>\n<li>执行代入操作</li>\n<li>计算结果的Gödel数</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>对本书固定的符号码、序列码与有效文法，公式码识别、解码、数码构造、无捕获代入和再编码都可通过有界搜索与结构递归实现</li>\n<li>因而在这一具体有效Gödel编号下，该全扩张是递归函数（事实上可取为原始递归）；该结论并不适用于任意抽象单射编号</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>保留当前具体语法下替换函数全扩张的递归性；原书前期证明路线实际选用 wrapper，且不是任意单射编号都有效。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 II 章 pp. 24–25（PDF 41–42）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"067a36526639087d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-substitution-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetization-formula","status":"resolved","id":"af5c6b1bb1806001","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetization-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"067a36526639087d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sub}$ (substitution function, see [[92-df-substitution-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rec}$ (recursive-function predicate, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)","display":false},{"tex":"m,n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat{\\mathrm{Sub}}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}sub\\text{-}recursive}\\vdash\n\\widehat{\\mathrm{Sub}}(m,n)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\mathrm{Sub}(m,n),&m\\in\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G),\\\\0,&m\\notin\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G),\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Rec}(\\widehat{\\mathrm{Sub}})","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat{\\mathrm{Sub}}","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}(m, n)","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar{n}","display":false}],"bytes":1958,"backlinks":[{"id":"6ad30e82597031a6","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本文件中的$d$以合法公式码为定义域；由[[92-fact-sub-recursive]]可得到它的全递归延拓。进一步说它在$G$中可表示，还需要相应的递归函数表示定理"},{"id":"659d57dcf656b1a5","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在本书固定的有效Gödel编号下，公式码识别与[[92-fact-sub-recursive]]给出的全递归代入共同保证该全扩张递归；任意抽象单射编号不自动具有此性质"},{"id":"07afadb094119590","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[92-fact-sub-recursive]]给出码层运算的全递归延拓；要断言该运算可在$G$内表示，还须调用递归函数表示定理"},{"id":"9fd00b865071e121","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"04751f66804591ae","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\widehat{\\mathrm{Sub}}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$ (total recursive extension, see [[92-fact-sub-recursive]])"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-375","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-fact-sub-recursive]]"}],"outgoing":["067a36526639087d","d65795dc15ebce4b","af5c6b1bb1806001"]}